    <string name="guide_done">Got it</string>
    <string name="guide_contact">Place a straightedge tangent to the last part of the takeoff. Rest the phone along it, screen up or on a long edge.</string>
    <string name="guide_direction">Point the top of the phone towards the lip. A plus means the takeoff rises towards the top of the phone; a minus means it falls.</string>
    <string name="guide_zero">Set zero on a known level surface in the same contact position. Screen up, left edge and right edge have separate calibration.</string>
    <string name="guide_lock">The angle updates live. Hold still until the ring fills, then lock and save. Stability is not a guarantee of sensor accuracy.</string>
